      "zh": "（示意）院長",
      "en": "(Demo) President"
    },
    "title": {
      "zh": "院長的話",
      "en": "Message from the President"
    },
    "photo": {
      "src": "assets/img/placeholder-portrait-light.svg",
      "alt": {
        "zh": "百年院慶標誌（示意圖）",
        "en": "Centennial emblem (placeholder)"
      },
      "width": 900,
      "height": 1200
    },
    "summary": {
      "zh": "（示意）一百年前，一群學者在南京立下「求真」的志向。一百年後，我們想和社會一起回答：下一個百年，臺灣的學術可以為世界帶來什麼？",
      "en": "(Demo) A hundred years ago, scholars in Nanjing set out to seek truth. What can Taiwan's research offer the world in the next century?"
    },
    "body": {
      "zh": "<p>（示意內文）一百年前，一群學者在南京立下「求真」的志向。他們相信，好的研究能讓社會看得更清楚，也能讓下一代走得更遠。</p><p>這一百年裡，本院經歷遷徙、重建與成長。從南港山腳下的幾間研究室，到今天橫跨數理、生命、人文社會科學的研究聚落，不變的是對知識的好奇與對社會的承諾。</p><p>百年院慶不只是回顧，更是邀請。我們希望和每一位關心學術的朋友一起思考：下一個百年，臺灣的研究可以為世界帶來什麼？歡迎走進院區、參加系列活動，和我們一起寫下新的篇章。</p>",
      "en": "<p>(Demo text) A hundred years ago, a group of scholars in Nanjing set out to seek truth, believing that good research helps society see more clearly.</p><p>Through relocation, rebuilding and growth, the Academy has become a research community spanning the sciences, life sciences, humanities and social sciences, driven by curiosity and commitment to society.</p><p>The centennial is not only a look back but an invitation: what can Taiwan's research offer the world in the next century? Join us on campus and at our events.</p>"
    },
    "salutation": {
      "zh": "各位朋友：",
      "en": "Dear friends,"
    },
